WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.707
Never sure when to leave for the bus?

2
00:00:04.707 --> 00:00:08.680
Meet Bus o’Clock, your Hong Kong commute companion.

3
00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.161
Search a route and choose your stop.

4
00:00:11.161 --> 00:00:14.052
Add your walking time
and a little buffer.

5
00:00:14.052 --> 00:00:18.163
Bus arrival estimates become a countdown
for when to head out.

6
00:00:18.163 --> 00:00:21.617
Save your regular journeys
and adjust your preferences.

7
00:00:21.617 --> 00:00:25.500
Use it on Android
or straight from your browser.
